Note Quiz Game with 20 questions across many topics.

Let score be 0.
Let question number be 1.
Let total questions be 20.
Let correct answer be 0.

Note Answer handler functions each button sets picked and calls check.
Define pick a,
    Let picked be 1.
    Call check answer.
End define.

Define pick b,
    Let picked be 2.
    Call check answer.
End define.

Define pick c,
    Let picked be 3.
    Call check answer.
End define.

Define pick d,
    Let picked be 4.
    Call check answer.
End define.

Define check answer,
    If the value of picked is equal to the value of correct answer,
        Add 1 to score.
    End if.
    Add 1 to question number.
    If the value of question number is greater than the value of total questions,
        Call show result.
    Otherwise,
        Call show question.
    End if.
End define.

Define show result,
    Clear window.
    Set title to Quiz Complete.
    Add label Quiz finished.
    Add label Your score.
    Add label the value of score plus out of plus total questions.
    Let percentage be the value of score times 100 divided by total questions.
    If the value of percentage is greater than or equal to 80,
        Add label Excellent work.
    Otherwise if the value of percentage is greater than or equal to 60,
        Add label Good job.
    Otherwise if the value of percentage is greater than or equal to 40,
        Add label Not bad keep studying.
    Otherwise,
        Add label Better luck next time.
    End if.
End define.

Define show question,
    Clear window.
    Set title to the value of Question plus question number plus of plus total questions.

    If the value of question number is equal to 1,
        Add label What is the capital of Australia.
        Set correct answer to 3.
        Add button with text London that calls pick a.
        Add button with text New York that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Canberra that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Sydney that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 2,
        Add label How many planets are in our solar system.
        Set correct answer to 2.
        Add button with text 7 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 8 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 9 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 10 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 3,
        Add label What is the chemical symbol for gold.
        Set correct answer to 4.
        Add button with text Gd that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Go that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Ag that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Au that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 4,
        Add label Which ocean is the largest.
        Set correct answer to 1.
        Add button with text Pacific that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Atlantic that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Indian that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Arctic that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 5,
        Add label What year did the Titanic sink.
        Set correct answer to 3.
        Add button with text 1905 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 1910 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 1912 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 1920 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 6,
        Add label How many bones does an adult human have.
        Set correct answer to 2.
        Add button with text 186 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 206 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 226 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 256 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 7,
        Add label What is the speed of light in km per second.
        Set correct answer to 3.
        Add button with text 150000 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 250000 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 300000 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 350000 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 8,
        Add label Which planet is known as the Red Planet.
        Set correct answer to 2.
        Add button with text Venus that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Mars that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Jupiter that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Saturn that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 9,
        Add label What is the largest mammal on Earth.
        Set correct answer to 4.
        Add button with text African Elephant that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Giraffe that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Great White Shark that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Blue Whale that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 10,
        Add label Who painted the Mona Lisa.
        Set correct answer to 1.
        Add button with text Leonardo da Vinci that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Michelangelo that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Raphael that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Donatello that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 11,
        Add label What is the smallest country in the world.
        Set correct answer to 3.
        Add button with text Monaco that calls pick a.
        Add button with text San Marino that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Vatican City that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Liechtenstein that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 12,
        Add label How many chromosomes do humans have.
        Set correct answer to 2.
        Add button with text 23 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 46 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 44 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 48 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 13,
        Add label What element does O represent on the periodic table.
        Set correct answer to 4.
        Add button with text Osmium that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Gold that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Oganesson that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Oxygen that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 14,
        Add label In what year did World War 2 end.
        Set correct answer to 1.
        Add button with text 1945 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 1944 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 1946 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 1943 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 15,
        Add label What is the longest river in the world.
        Set correct answer to 3.
        Add button with text Amazon that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Mississippi that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Nile that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Yangtze that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 16,
        Add label What is the hardest natural substance.
        Set correct answer to 2.
        Add button with text Titanium that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Diamond that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Quartz that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Graphene that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 17,
        Add label How many hearts does an octopus have.
        Set correct answer to 4.
        Add button with text 1 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 2 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 5 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 3 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 18,
        Add label Which continent has the most countries.
        Set correct answer to 1.
        Add button with text Africa that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Asia that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Europe that calls pick c.
        Add button with text South America that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 19,
        Add label What is the boiling point of water in Celsius.
        Set correct answer to 3.
        Add button with text 90 that calls pick a.
        Add button with text 95 that calls pick b.
        Add button with text 100 that calls pick c.
        Add button with text 110 that calls pick d.
    Otherwise if the value of question number is equal to 20,
        Add label What gas do plants absorb from the atmosphere.
        Set correct answer to 2.
        Add button with text Oxygen that calls pick a.
        Add button with text Carbon Dioxide that calls pick b.
        Add button with text Nitrogen that calls pick c.
        Add button with text Hydrogen that calls pick d.
    End if.

    Shuffle buttons.
    Add label the value of Score plus score plus of plus total questions.
End define.

Open window with title Quiz Game.
Set window size to 500 by 400.
Call show question.
Wait for close.
